comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T19:02:14.338Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh orientation, request-specific search, open/in-progress inventories and complete strict 3126-item all-status corpus found no open owner for this exact case. Full live metadata and histories of related owners confirm their completed, distinct scope. This is intake only, open and unclaimed; implementation is outside the current delivery cohort."
  "2026-10-26T22:07:05.127Z","harness:codex","Confirmed the existing update contract clears every blocked_by relationship through --unset blocked-by; an explicit dep-remove is unnecessary. The original unsupported block/unblock calls failed the new guidance regression. SDK-owned intent templates now check declared update flags and decline installed or ambiguous command paths. Native recovery controls use two blockers, clear blocker metadata, preserve an unrelated related edge, retain usage exit 2 and unchanged history on refusal, and preserve tracker scope in the inspection-only help retry. Focused cohort passed 96 tests."
  "2026-10-26T23:06:14.959Z","harness:codex","The published npm artifact reproduces both unsupported-verb problems: block exits2 with901 stderr bytes and no blocker-mutation recipe; unblock exits2 with810 bytes and no cleanup recipe. Current Node and Bun consumers retain exit2 and provide the appropriate block or unblock template (963 and1213 bytes). The extra guidance supplies the previously missing action and explicitly keeps project-specific blocked-status selection separate. Native two-blocker tests prove exact relation cleanup and preservation of unrelated relations; no inferred mutation is executed by a refusal."
  "2026-10-26T23:58:45.952Z","harness:codex","Hosted acceptance for source head58e8f12264497c1411f29afd78d139b406231663: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40420598204. Exact aggregate coverage has zero uncovered counts; native Windows regression and all packed first-run checks pass. The first static job fails solely active planner completeness on this delivery task (estimate and expected result); both fields were supplied through pm and local tracker-context assurance now passes. Full revised-head static/check/review acceptance is still mandatory before merge. Preserve the failed local coverage attempt and separate qualified Node26 admission failures; no overall-green claim is made for the first workflow."
  "2026-10-27T02:46:17.088Z","harness:codex","Review1608 negative-control clarification: candidate9dad0a28c87beb0fbb66f9eec9f7360f9bf549dd with ONLY src/cli/commander-usage.ts replaced by ce979159acfe034217a5694a3e826940895b3581. The recorded runnable control archives immutable source into a disposable checkout, uses sandboxed PM roots, and requires exactly the named AssertionError before intentionally returning exit1; setup/runtime failure returns3. Executed now and proved the intended failure. Current passing local_checks are separate. Existing immutable events remain preserved; no prior history was edited."
  "2026-10-27T03:34:10.707Z","harness:codex","Full-review correction: installed Vitest4.1.12 JSON reporter stores suite-level runtime errors in testResults[].message and does not emit numRuntimeErrorTestSuites. The current runnable negative control requires every suite message to be exactly empty, alongside the single named AssertionError and native exit1. This corrected immutable-source replay was executed and proved the intended failure. A missing, nonempty or malformed suite message refuses proof. Existing historical events remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-27T03:35:44.270Z","harness:codex","Current reviewed production/test source8bedb5f771be697dffacb3397f55565a429be9f6 completes CI40442741640 successfully: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40442741640 . The current scoped adapter and lifecycle spec are included, along with canonical interpreter refinement. Hosted exact aggregate coverage job121990397778 passes100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts; native Windows and all six packed first-run platform/runtime legs pass. This refresh supplements the immutable source-specific58e8f evidence instead of rewriting it. The next metadata-only intake/replay correction head still requires its own exact-head checks and review before merge."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T22:10:50.419Z","harness:codex","The supported unblock operation is the existing --unset blocked-by contract, which removes the primary scalar and every blocked_by edge. Guidance should reuse that primitive rather than build an incomplete dep-remove recipe or imply a note changes graph readiness."
